@url=http://localhost:3000


### Obtener vehiculos

GET {{url}}/vehiculos

### Consultar por un vehiculo
GET {{url}}/vehiculos/3


### Crear vehiculo
POST {{url}}/vehiculos

Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Ford",
    "modelo": "Fiesta",
    "patente": "AA200HY",
    "anio": 2016,
    "capacidad_carga": 900
}

### Actualizar vehiculo

PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/2

Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Ford",
    "modelo": "Ranger XLS",
    "patente": "AB123CD",
    "anio": 2023,
    "capacidad_carga": 1300
}

### Eliminar vehiculo
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/3
